      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-08-19T17:42:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hmmm. Thats a good call. Nobody ever plays against Spite while playtesting...</p><p>Well, infinite combos as a rule of thumb are not allowed. Treat it as Blitz only being a singular use of the power that repeats its effect if the conditional phrase is met. That will sure-up this interaction and keep the power working as intended.</p><p>Nice catch. I'm sure this will be errata'ed in the video game.</p><p>Edit: Nvm its already fixed in the video game!</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:06:06.812Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 15556,
      "topic_slug": "f5-tachyon-vs-spite-infinite-combo",
      "display_username": "Foote",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
