      "id": 181370,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-08-19T20:51:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It works like this because reactions to using powers don't react until the power finishes. &nbsp;The repeating the power is part of the power's effect.</p><p>Similarly to one-shots that play more cards staying in play until the chain is finished. &nbsp;Spite has to wait until the power chain is done before Tachyon is counted as having used a power. &nbsp;Because until she chooses to not put a burst card from her trash under her deck the first use o Blitz is still going on.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:06:06.886Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
