      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>It works like this because reactions to using powers don&#39;t react until the power finishes. &nbsp;The repeating the power is part of the power&#39;s effect.</p><p>Similarly to one-shots that play more cards staying in play until the chain is finished. &nbsp;Spite has to wait until the power chain is done before Tachyon is counted as having used a power. &nbsp;Because until she chooses to not put a burst card from her trash under her deck the first use o Blitz is still going on.</p>",
